N_CITIES            34
POP_SIZE            600
N_GENERATIONS       300
GENERATE_COORDS     False
COORDS_TYPE         Circular

ENDINPUT

Type of coordinates:
- Circular: city coordinates uniformly distributed on a circumference
- Square: city coordinates uniformly distributed inside a Square

When GENERATE_COORDS is True, coordinates are generated, if it is false, coordinates are read from a file and the content of COORDS_TYPE and N_CITIES is irrelevant.